sion", "target_term": "有限扩张"}, {"source_term": "an effective formal versal deformation", "target_term": "有效形式半普适形变"}, {"source_term": "a scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "a closed point", "target_term": "闭点"}, {"source_term": "residue field", "target_term": "剩余域"}, {"source_term": "an isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "the restrictions", "target_term": "限制"}, {"source_term": "a universal deformation", "target_term": "普适形变"}, {"source_term": "The algebraization", "target_term": "该代数化"}, {"source_term": "the representability of the Hilbert and Picard schemes", "target_term": "Hilbert 概形与 Picard 概形的可表性"}], "term_status": "DECISION_REQUIRED", "translation": "论文证明，在温和假设（mild hypotheses）下，任意有效形式半普适形变（any effective formal versal deformation）均可代数化（is algebraizable）。设 <MATH_0001> 是局部有限表示的反变函子（a contravariant functor locally of finite presentation），<MATH_0002> 在某个域或优异离散赋值环上为有限型（finite type over a field or excellent DVR），<MATH_0003> 是局部闭点（a locally closed point），<MATH_0004> 是 <MATH_0005> 上的完备 Noether 局部代数（a complete Noetherian local algebra），其剩余域（residue field）<MATH_0006> 是 <MATH_0007> 的有限扩张（a finite extension），而 <MATH_0008> 是元素 <MATH_0009> 的有效形式半普适形变（an effective formal versal deformation）。则存在概形（a scheme）<MATH_0010>，它在 <MATH_0011> 上有限型（finite type）；还存在闭点（a closed point）<MATH_0012>，其剩余域（residue field）为 <MATH_0013>，并且存在元素 <MATH_0014>，使得存在同构（an isomorphism）<MATH_0015>，它把 <MATH_0016> 与 <MATH_0017> 在各个 <MATH_0018> 中的限制（the restrictions）对应起来。若 <MATH_0019> 是普适形变（a universal deformation），则该代数化（The algebraization）唯一。论文还将这一结果应用于 Hilbert 概形与 Picard 概形的可表性（the representability of the Hilbert and Picard schemes）。", "translation_hash": "sha256:943297cc83f1e7d8e704cf0acc424804dbbecebf8128a1eab157f14fcb345e61", "unit_id": "tag:04UW:item002-quote", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "Artin 代数化定理所需的假设强度。", "source_term": "mild hypotheses", "target_term": "温和假设"}, {"context": "定理声称可代数化的形变。", "source_term": "any eff