y a scheme）的栈都具有由概形给出的光滑表示（a smooth presentation by a scheme）；因而特别可以对平坦、分离、有限表示群概形（flat, separated, finitely presented group schemes）构造商栈（quotient stacks）。", "translation_hash": "sha256:9f511919241d94ed93109b1214d8b3d4b7f3770d1325b488c39d9deb37e3795a", "unit_id": "tag:04UW:item004-quote", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "论文引入的代数性判据。", "source_term": "Artin's criterion", "target_term": "Artin 判据"}, {"context": "应用 Artin 判据时需要检验的性质。", "source_term": "deformation-theoretic properties", "target_term": "形变理论性质"}, {"context": "Artin 判据所证明的目标性质。", "source_term": "algebraicity of a stack", "target_term": "一个栈的代数性"}, {"context": "Artin 局部构造表示的栈。", "source_term": "a limit preserving stack", "target_term": "保极限栈"}, {"context": "在给定点附近构造的表示。", "source_term": "a presentation", "target_term": "一个表示"}, {"context": "保证形式半普适形变存在的条件。", "source_term": "Schlessinger's criterion", "target_term": "Schlessinger 判据"}, {"context": "Schlessinger 判据给出的形变。", "source_term": "a formal versal deformation", "target_term": "形式半普适形变"}, {"context": "把形式形变提升为有效对象的假设。", "source_term": "formal deformations are effective", "target_term": "形式形变是有效的"}, {"context": "形式形变有效性的具体映射条件。", "source_term": "is bijective", "target_term": "是双射"}, {"context": "有效性假设后得到的形变。", "source_term": "an effective formal versal deformation", "target_term": "有效形式半普适形变"}, {"context": "Artin 代数化构造出的概形。", "source_term": "a finite type scheme", "target_term": "有限型概形"}, {"context": "所构造态射在指定点的性质。", "source_term": "formally versal", "target_term": "形式半普适"}, {"context": "证明光滑性所需的理论。", "source_term": "a deformation and obstruction theory", "target_term": "形变与障碍理论"}, {"context": "形变与障碍理论需满足的条件之一。", "source_term": "compatibility with <LATIN_0001> localization and completion", "target_term": "与平展局部化和完备化的相容性"}, {"context": "形变与障碍理论需满足的条件之一。", "source_term": "constructibility condition", "target_term": "可构造性条件"}, {"context": "论文证明为开条件的性质。", "source_term": "formal versality", "target_term": "形式半普适性"}, {"context": "形式半普适性的局部性质。", "source_term": "